    "title": "Community guidelines refresher (2-minute read)",
    "body": "Quick refresher as the community grows — nothing has changed, we just have new neighbours. 1) Debate ideas, not people. Heat is fine; contempt is not. 2) Right tag, right shelf — it keeps search useful for everyone. 3) One promo post per offer, please. Reposting the same pitch is how things get removed. 4) Health claims need care: share your experience, do not prescribe. 5) See something? Report it — do not fight it in the comments. We read every report. Ka fikir ka hor inta aadan qorin: erayadaadu waa martida guriga bulshada. Soo dhawaada dhammaantiin — welcome, all of you.",
