    "title": "Af waa guri — the practice circle is open / Goobta layliga waa furan tahay",
    "body": "Af waa guri: furaha waxaad ka dhaxashay hooyadaa, albaabkana adigaa iska furaya. Every Sunday we sit in a circle — diaspora learners on one side of the tongue, native speakers on the other, shaah in the middle. Come learn the language your grandmother dreams in. Week one you may speak whatever mix falls out of your mouth; by week four, af Soomaali keliya — ha cabsan, gestures count, dramatic pointing counts double. Qaanuunkeennu waa mid keliya: qalad kastaa waa caddayn inaad isku dayday, waana lagu sacbin doonaa. Sign-up is open in the space. Kaalay — shaahu waa diyaar, macalimiintu waa dulqaad badan yihiin, qosolkuna waa bilaash.",
